      "zh": "所以我必与你并你的江河为敌，使埃及地，从色弗尼塔直到古实境界，全然荒废凄凉。",
      "en": "I am against[NOTE:1] you and your waterways. I will turn the land of Egypt into an utter desolate ruin from Migdol[NOTE:2] to Syene,[NOTE:3] as far as the border with Ethiopia.",
